                            w::r = [
                                w::t = "Notwithstanding anything in clause 1.8 of the Rules or in Part A — Overview, any reference to actions a person \"should\" take or anything a person \"should\" do is intended to convey a best practice with which a person should comply with only, but which has no legal effect."
